  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving and Consolidating Social Harmony and Social Equality in Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project intends to promote social harmony and social equality in all communities by providing civil society groups with capacity building trainings and the information they need to undertake peace building activities. Activities are designed to enhance the role of women in conflict.

The project document consists of two distinct components. The first component of the project is designed to promote social harmony and social equality in all communities in Myanmar. The second component of the project is scholarship fund addressing the lack of access to higher education among the ethnic minority youths. The contribution will be used to provide scholarship funds towards high school graduates among the marginalized community to help them to get access to university education, informal life skill education and vocational training services.</narrative>
  </description>
